    "message": "test(export): assert store is not None so ty narrows RequestLogStore | None\n\nCI's ty check runs over the whole repo including tests, which caught that\nget_request_log_store returns RequestLogStore | None and the export tests\ncalled .enqueue/.close/.iter_export_rows on the possibly-None union. The\nproject rule is to fix the underlying type, not add a suppression, so each\ncall site now asserts the store exists before use.\n\nVerified: `uv run ty check` passes repo-wide; all 26 export tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
